# Module-level on purpose: _offh_segment_hits_obb used bare math.sin/cos with no
# import in scope, so EVERY call raised NameError.  Both of its callers swallow
# exceptions and treat a failure as "blocked", which silently closed every
# firing lane that had a hull test (LOSPROBE exception=114 fire=114 spot=0,
# NameError: global name 'math' is not defined at line 4489) - bots could only
# ever shoot inside the 60 m LOS bypass.  The 52 function-local `import math`
# statements below keep working unchanged; they just shadow this one.
import math
